  "implementation": [
    "App-private Request/Options child visitors preserve actual source/edit/Owned Cow/selected Vec/String capacities, fixed-field audit and borrowed static interval behavior. Child graphs genuinely require bytes only; no fabricated positive entry/root tests.",
    "Generation Work retains a concrete independently admitted SelectionSnapshot containing actual baseline hashes, profile identity, options and imported flag. Parsed Request is independently admitted; both existing Session and Request inputs survive actual detached generation and final batch admission.",
    "Finite selection metadata preparation borrows the retained snapshot, preserving original remapping/JSON/scientific behavior. Existing queue/staging target guards remain intact.",
    "Export Input contains actual parsed Request and fixed Selection; admission precedes worker publication and its guard survives through actual Prepared target admission. Later input rejection and spawn failure preserve prior Ready.",
    "No new public API, binding/schema, dependency/registration or accounting framework. Terminal error/Saved payloads, control/closure/channel/fixed infrastructure and persistent QML remain pending."
  ],
